OL,3,A'It's torture and torment without
OL,4,Aanswers' - dad of teen killed in blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeona Harper's coat still hangs in the
OL,7,Fhallway of her family home.
OL,9,FThe soil from the pitch of the last
OL,10,Fgame she played is still on her rugby
OL,11,Fboots.
OL,13,FHer bedroom remains untouched.
OL,15,FFour years on from the Creeslough
OL,16,Fexplosion that claimed the 14-year-old
OL,17,Fschoolgirl's life, along with nine
OL,18,Fothers, her father says their family
OL,19,Fremains "desperate for answers" about
OL,20,Fthe events of that day.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
